I couldn’t find any actor who satisfies all of the five conditions:

* be born between 1970‑1990;  
* star in a 2000s film in which the writer also played the lead;  
* be born in a city whose population was less than 7 000;  
* have multiple half‑siblings; and  
* leave an art school in their senior year.

Available biographical pages contain only partial matches (e.g., Drew Barrymore has a birth year and several half‑siblings, but her hometown is far larger than 7 000 and there is no record of her leaving an art school). No source I could locate confirms every requirement simultaneously.

